    "notes": "Sprint S1f75ec collapses claude-agent/claude-tui into one branch-scoped 'Claude' tab (案 A), wires Toolbar auto-mode + ESC ESC, integrates Activity Inbox events from the TUI daemon (permission_prompt regex + BEL throttle), adds image/file paste & drop (reusing /api/upload), and removes the brittle MobileChatView surface (-700 LoC net). 31 ACs / 32 tests (AC-2-3 has 2 directional cases) / 0 fail / 0 skip. The paste tests use a defaultPrevented-based assertion (the stable observable signal that the handler intercepted the event) because Playwright route mocks for binary multipart bodies are unreliable across back-to-back tests — POST /api/upload is exercised structurally in the mock progress test. Post-verify fix (commit after the sprint-level review): wired RepoStore.InitBranchSettings into store.openBranchInternal so the documented settings.claude.default_mode override actually propagates to new branches, and added the two tests above which exercise both directional defaults (tui and agent). The previously-claimed AC-2-3 test never existed and the global-default code path was unreachable — both were fixed before sprint done."
